<p>currency from 1999</p>
<p>    France should be among	64	  32	     4</p>
<p>those nations adopting</p>
<p>a single European</p>
<p>currency from 1999</p>
<p>    A single European	     55	  41	     4</p>
<p>currency will be put</p>
<p>into place as expected</p>
<p>on January 1, 1999</p>
